# Learning lab exception: nodes run in public subnets without NAT Gateway or
# paid VPC endpoints, so subnet public IP assignment is required for node
# bootstrap, ECR/image pulls, AWS API calls, and Helm downloads.
AWS-0164

# Learning lab exception: terraform-aws-eks module creates broad node egress.
